<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PAG LTD UNIT APPOINTS NEW MANAGING DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>PAG LTD UNIT APPOINTS NEW MANAGING DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Management and personnel consultancy PAG Ltd's subsidiary PAG Placements said on Thursday it had appointed a new managing director as from November 1.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement the new managing director, Louis de Waal, would also join listed parent company PAG Ltd's main board.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
